I counted four instances of the BE symbol (a circle with a slash, labelled "BE"). I did not call zoom and judged from the overview alone. They are at roughly (433, 70), (319, 453), (492, 838) and (432, 1208).

I left out the "WM" symbols near the top edge because they are filled circles. I also left out the "GE" symbol at the bottom left because its label differs.

